kickoff (the Sunday run) (new: 0.5u through its first live season)"}, {"stars": 2, "name": "New Coach Bump", "win": "55.0%", "record": "54-37 (59.3%)", "rate": 0.5934, "stake": 0.5, "sample": "Small", "where": "NFL card, 0.5u", "why": "A team that changed head coaches mid-season, in the new coach's first 3 games: back it. The market still prices the fired coach's results; teams respond to the change (small backtest of 91 bets: 0.5u until it has a live record)"}, {"stars": 3, "name": "Follow the Money Total", "win": "56.4%", "record": "137-95 (59.1%)", "rate": 0.5905, "stake": 0.5, "sample": "Medium", "where": "NFL card, 0.5u (new: first live season)", "why": "On a game's total, the share of MONEY on one side is 15+ points higher than its share of TICKETS: fewer, bigger bets are there. Bet that side near kickoff (the Sunday run; needs that day's splits screenshot) (new: 0.5u through its first live season)"}, {"stars": 1, "name": "Kicking-Luck Fade", "win": "54.3%", "record": "37-26 (58.7%)", "rate": 0.5873, "stake": 0.5, "sample": "Small", "where": "NFL card, 0.5u", "why": "Team kicking 1.5+ pts/game above expected this season: field-goal luck fades"}, {"stars": 3, "name": "Dog Teaser (2-team)", "win": "56.7%", "record": "378-108 (77.8% per leg)", "rate": 0.5809, "stake": 1.0, "sample": "Big", "where": "NFL card, 1u", "why": "Underdog +1.5 to +2.5 in a game totaled under 49, teased 6 pts through 3 and 7; pair two legs"}, {"stars": 2, "name": "Q Full Practice", "win": "55.1%", "record": "102-76 (57.3%)", "rate": 0.573, "stake": 0.5, "sample": "Medium", "where": "NFL card, 0.5u (new: first live season)", "why": "2+ regular starters listed QUESTIONABLE but they practiced IN FULL on the final practice day, and the opponent has none: the market marks the team down for the tag, but these players almost always play. Back them (needs Friday's report, so the Saturday run) (new: 0.5u through its first live season)"}, {"stars": 2, "name": "Primetime Blowout Winner", "win": "55.